basil 5.3.1 — the parser-table generator for this repo's grammar
=================================================================

`basil` is the backtracking LR(1) parser generator by Michael Spencer
(lzz's author) that produced the checked-in generated files in
gram/rules/ (gram_ParserData.lzz, gram_Nonterm.lzz, gram_Visitor.lzz,
gram_TokenNumber.lzz).  Its SOURCE WAS NEVER PUBLISHED; version 5.3.1
(released 2002-03-21) is the only build ever distributed, and this
statically linked i386 ELF is, as far as we can tell, the only
surviving artifact capable of regenerating the tables.  Guard it.

